Project Overview

This project implements an AI-driven monitoring system for Generative AI applications using a Knowledge Graph, semantic similarity, rule-based validation, confidence scoring, and human feedback.

The system is designed to identify potentially unsupported or contradictory AI-generated responses by comparing them with information stored in a Knowledge Graph.

A Streamlit dashboard provides an interactive interface for entering AI-generated responses, analyzing them, viewing the validation result, and maintaining a monitoring history.
